  ObjectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 604ab484e834cd14185541e30b00b605, type: 3}
  Facts:
  - text: "The Living Leaf!\nSea dragons are relatives of seahorses, and they look
      like floating seaweed to stay safe from predators.\nTheir leafy fins don\u2019t
      help them swim fast\u2014they're for camouflage, not speed.\nThey drift gently
      through the water, blending into coral and kelp like underwater ninjas.\nIt\u2019s
      not a mythical dragon\u2014but it\u2019s just as magical!"
